    "body": "The tanks and trucks are rolling away from the convention center, and drones are being packed away until the next show. But before the 2026 AUSA conference concluded, Secretary of Defense Pete Hegseth made an appearance, delivering a speech to scores of servicemembers and industry figures.\nLand Warfare Reporter Carley Welch and Editor-in-Chief Aaron Mehta talk about what Hegseth said, plus wrap up the general themes of this year’s conference.\nIf you missed our other videos, you can find them here . And for our comprehensive written coverage of the show, click here .",
